  "content": "<html>\n<body>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"SulfurCubes+\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/github_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fSulfurCubesPlus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/modrinth_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/SulfurCubesPlus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/curseforge_icon_bg.png\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a>\n</p>\n<div><div><h3 style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700\">支援版本：</h3><img width=\"165\" height=\"84\" alt=\"Minecraft 1.26.2\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/26.2.png\"></div></div>\n<h2>功能</h2>\n<h3>TNT 立方體</h3>\n<p>v26.2 快照 5 起，**Mojang 本身就為硫磺立方體加入了 TNT 支援**。做得好！🎉</p>\n<p>這個模塊最初的功能是由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fTheJoeFly%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">u/TheJoeFly</a> 啟發（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fPhoenixSC%252fcomments%252f1s03lww%252fnow_the_important_question_will_we_be_able_to%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原文</a>）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/tnt_inspiration.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>自 v0.7.0 起，本模塊使用原版實現。唯一的改進在於：引信在受到任何直接命中時觸發，而立方體越大，爆炸範圍也越大。現在甚至可以製備「硫磺核彈」。但要怎麼獲得那麼大的立方體呢？</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/tnt_showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>光立方體</h3>\n<p>吸收了發光方塊的硫磺立方體，如今會像基岩版那樣在遊戲世界中真正發光。</p>\n<p><strong>兼容方塊：</strong>燧石·海之燈·泣淚黑曜石·岩浆方块·蕈粉·南瓜燈·土黃蛙亮晶·珍珠蛙亮晶·綠蘆蛙亮晶</p>\n<div><img alt=\"沒有 Sulfur Cubes+ 則不會發光\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/light_showcase_off.png\" width=\"360\"> <img alt=\"有 Sulfur Cubes+ 時會發光\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/light_showcase_on.png\" width=\"360\"></div>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/light_cubes_showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>仙人掌立方體</h3>\n<p>硫磺立方體現在可以吸收仙人掌。任何接觸到仙人掌立方體的實體都會受到傷害，就像踩踏放置的仙人掌一樣；攻擊者也會受到仙人掌傷害——如同真實擊打仙人掌。其他靠近仙人掌立方體或仙人掌方塊的硫磺立方體將會被推開。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/cactus_cube.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/cactus_showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>工作站立方體</h3>\n<p>硫磺立方體現在可以吸收工作台。右鍵打開對應 UI，按住 Shift 再右鍵可取走立方體。</p>\n<p><strong>兼容方塊：</strong>工作台·石匠台·研磨台·鍛造台·織布機·地圖桌·鐵砧</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/workstation_cubes.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/workstation_showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>紅石立方體</h3>\n<p>硫磺立方體現在可以吸收紅石粉立方體。此立方體類似於放置的紅石粉，可作為信號源向六個方向供電。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/redstone_showcase.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>烈焰人立方體</h3>\n<p>啟發來自 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fuser%252fJakeroni5%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">u/Jakeroni5</a>（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fPhoenixSC%252fcomments%252f1sml267%252fan_iq_too_high%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">原文</a>）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/ghast_inspiration.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>硫磺立方體現在可以吸收<strong>枯死的烈焰人</strong>，只需將其浸入水中即可使其重新活化。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/ghast_cube_feed.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>完全水合後，枯死的烈焰人將重獲新生，生成一隻幼年的<strong>快樂烈焰人</strong>，並進入<strong>烈焰靈模式</strong>——半透明的靈魂外殼將圍繞住小烈焰人，隨其成長壯大。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/ghast_cube_hydration.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/ghast_cube_soul_mode.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>用<strong>剪刀</strong>剪立方體隨時解放烈焰人，以此獲取四級大小的硫磺立方體。已完成靈魂迴圈的立方體無法再次水合。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fweigel-dev/SulfurCubesPlus/refs/heads/main/README/ghast_cube_shear.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>其他具有功能的支援方塊：</h3>\n<p>命令方塊·重核·下界合金磚·粉狀雪·海綿·濕海綿·末棍·銅燈（所有變體）</p>\n<hr>\n<p>未來將持續增加更多方塊支援。</p>\n</body>\n</html>",
